Description: Use an available writable local temporary directory for copy tests
Author: Peios maintainers
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-09-16

The build sandbox exposes /var/tmp read-only. Test the same copy operations
in /tmp when /var/tmp is unavailable for writes; do not skip the test.
This only changes test fixtures, not installed code.

--- a/gettext-tools/gnulib-tests/test-copy-file-1.sh
+++ b/gettext-tools/gnulib-tests/test-copy-file-1.sh
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
 
 . "${srcdir=.}/init.sh"; path_prepend_ .
 
-if test -d /var/tmp; then
+if test -d /var/tmp && test -w /var/tmp; then
   TMPDIR=/var/tmp
 else
   TMPDIR=/tmp
